%h2.mb-3 Admin sign-in
%p.text-muted Use the passkey you registered for this site (Touch ID, phone or password manager).
%button.btn.btn-primary{type: "button", autofocus: true,
  data: { passkey_action: "sign-in",
          options_url: comfy_admin_sign_in_options_path,
          verify_url: comfy_admin_sign_in_path }}
  Sign in with a passkey
%p.small.mt-3{data: { passkey_status: true }, role: "status"}
%p.small.text-muted.mt-4.mb-0
  Locked out? In a production Rails console, run
  %code puts AdminRecovery.url
  and open the link within 15 minutes.
